                                                "sense_id": "0f42ed2f-b198-312d-85b3-0526d2b6eabf",
                                                "text": "In this study, we propose a means of studying metabolism, using the concept of the “metabolome”, or total complement of metabolites in a cell, to look at global shifts in cellular function under different growth conditions."
